# Build context = D:/project (parent of komiku-server, needed for path dep
# ../komik/core). Everything below is either heavy sibling projects or
# generated artifacts the server build never reads.

# --- Rust build artifacts (the big one: komik/target 2.1G, komiku-server/target 2.9G) ---
**/target/
**/Cargo.lock.orig

# --- node/vite ---
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/

# --- VCS / tooling / local state ---
# Tailwind v4 auto-source menghormati .gitignore di cwd (/build/komiku-web).
# Jika file itu hilang dari build context, direktori scratch (.checktmp/ sisa
# harness verifikasi) ikut dipindai dan CSS container menyimpang dari dist/
# lokal yang di-QA (7 aturan CSS mati, +314 B). Kirim HANYA .gitignore milik
# komiku-web lewat negasi supaya context stage server tidak berubah (cache
# `cargo build --release` tetap aman). Scratch tetap di-exclude eksplisit
# sebagai defense-in-depth. Lihat _audit_shots/qa/QA_FINAL.md.
**/.git/
**/.gitattributes
**/.gitignore
!komiku-web/.gitignore
.omh/
.hermes/
.hermes-tmp.*
**/.checktmp/
**/.checkbase
**/__pycache__/

# --- heavy sibling projects NOT needed by the server build ---
3d-html-site/
akata/
alif-3d-portfolio/
alif-pixel-portfolio/
archived/
getcontact-cli/
graphify-out/
hermes-webui/
jev-explainer-video/
komiku-apk/
komiku-re/
old/
OpenIntelligentUI/
PortaText/
porto-website-persona5-alif/
pwtest/
qa/
scroll-craft-demo/
unword/
WA-Bulk/
zombie-city-zx25r/
zqa-blank/
bot-discord.txt

# --- VM disk images ---
*.vhdx
*.vhd
*.iso

# --- logs / scratch inside the needed dirs ---
*.log
komiku-server/data/
komiku-server/downloads/
komiku-server/graphify-out/
komik/graphify-out/
